1
00:00:17,101 --> 00:00:24,248
I know that it might sound dumb to say that you're my number one

2
00:00:24,845 --> 00:00:32,117
But I can't seem to find a way, no other way for me to say

3
00:00:32,647 --> 00:00:40,233
that you transcend my space and time. There really is no reason or rhyme

4
00:00:40,565 --> 00:00:49,062
I just can't seem to stay away. You light up my naivete

5
00:00:49,122 --> 00:00:55,234
Who knows how many times we'll go around the sun?

6
00:00:56,993 --> 00:01:03,055
But all I know is that you'll always be the one

7
00:01:04,888 --> 00:01:11,465
Even if you happen to leave me behind

8
00:01:12,713 --> 00:01:22,335
I will always be yours and you will always be mine

9
00:01:23,743 --> 00:01:29,320
'Cause you are the love of my life

10
00:01:43,654 --> 00:01:51,404
Even though we sometimes fight and I want you out of my sight

11
00:01:51,444 --> 00:01:58,880
It only takes a sorry glance to give each other another chance

12
00:01:58,944 --> 00:02:07,045
And one day we won't be so young. I'll try to remember how it once was

13
00:02:07,106 --> 00:02:14,767
